[Eb]The [Ab]dark[Eb]ness [Ab]deep[Eb]ens; [Fm7]Lord, [Bb]with [Eb]me [F7]a[Bb]bide!
[Eb]When [Bb]other [Cm]help[Eb]ers [Ab]fail, and [C7]comforts [Fm]flee,
