[Bb7]O[Eb]Lord, [Gm7]have [Ab]mercy [Bb7]on[Ab]me.[Eb]

Verse 2:
[Eb]Let [Cm]us [Fm7]drink [Bb7]wine [Eb]together [Ab]on [Eb]our knees,
[Eb]let [Cm]us [F]drink wine [Bb]together [Cm]on [Bb]our knees.
